{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>And you shall measure from outside the city, etc., two thousand cubits</b> — that two thousand cubits are outside the seventy cubits and remainder. And this is \"and you shall measure from outside the city\":"], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {0 "The phrase 'seventy cubits and remainder' refers to the dimensions of the city itself, from which the two thousand cubits of open space are measured outward."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:23:45.637734888Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}